{"id":"n55874-1-7","stage":0,"title":"목요일 · 星期四","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55874-1-7-1","ko":"그럼 약속 날짜는 언제로 정할까?","zh":"那我们约哪天？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"약속","meaning":"约会、约定","explanation":"약속：约定见面；这里指约好见面的日期。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}},{"text":"날짜는","meaning":"日期","explanation":"날짜：日期；-는 标记话题。","readings":[{"term":"날짜","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58157","senseId":"2","lemma":"날짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날짜는","audio":"/audio/d200c3779ee21ef99f2b.mp3"}},{"text":"언제로","meaning":"哪一天","explanation":"언제：什么时候；-로 在这里表示选定的时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제로","audio":"/audio/98848aa0884462d0956f.mp3"}},{"text":"정할까?","meaning":"定呢","explanation":"정하다：决定、选定；-ㄹ까? 用来商量“定哪天”。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정할까","audio":"/audio/f246ab233dd0e19713ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先约好与别人见面或做事；这里指见面的安排。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"09f76a1b7a6712ee","term":"날짜","zh":"日子，日期","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3","entryId":"58157","definition":"为了做什么事而定下的时间。","pronunciation":["날짜"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"定，选定","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"从几个里面选一个。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6633cd2cedddc23850e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55874-1-7-2","ko":"음, 이번 주 목요일은 어때?","zh":"嗯，这周四怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"음：思考时发出的语气词，这里是在考虑日期。","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"1","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这、本","explanation":"이번：当前这一次；이번 주 指“这周”。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"주","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}},{"text":"목요일은","meaning":"星期四","explanation":"목요일：星期四；-은 标记话题，提出周四供对方考虑。","readings":[{"term":"목요일","audio":"/audio/42d1a6367432ff8ec3d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55874","senseId":"1","lemma":"목요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목요일은","audio":"/audio/ad8ffd9a41773e34074e.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"嗯","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","entryId":"71111","definition":"思考或迟疑时发出的声音；这里是在考虑约定日期。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"当前这一次；이번 주 指这周。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"42d1a6367432ff8e","term":"목요일","zh":"星期四，周四，礼拜四","audio":"/audio/42d1a6367432ff8ec3d4.mp3","entryId":"55874","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第四天。","pronunciation":["모교일"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b400fb33269b5fb53159.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55874","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.1253,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，这周四怎么样？","那我们约哪天？","打扰一下，请问现在几点？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那我们约哪天？","打扰一下，请问现在几点？","嗯，这周四怎么样？"],"answer":2}]}
